WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:06.006
MOM: YOU CAN QUIT ANYTIME,
BUT FOR NOW GIVE IT YOUR ALL!

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:09.759
Flight Leader Kakiyasu!

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:12.470
Hisone Amakasu has made contact!

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:15.724
Um, Flight Leader Kakiyasu,

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:18.268
I'm sorry this has gotten out of hand.

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:20.729
I'm still holding onto my life,

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:24.107
but I at this rate, I might lose it
before I can apologize.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.859
I don't care about an apology!

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:27.861
Where are you flying now?!

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:30.321
How did you get a cell signal
from inside the OTF?!

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:32.657
I got it! It's the rear riser headpiece!

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.827
I can't pinpoint their location,

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:39.456
but I've confirmed a signal coming from
the OTC prototype 16 safety visor!

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:45.045
Maybe we're receiving correspondence
because Amakasu has the headpiece!

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:50.175
Have the instrumentation unit determine
the OTF's position now!

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.969
As soon as we have it,
send fighter planes to escort them!

00:00:53.344 --> 00:00:55.138
-Amakasu!
-Yes!

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:56.473
Are you ready?

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.225
I need you to do exactly as I direct you.

00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:00.643
-You got that?
-Yes!

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:02.771
You've got the headpiece on, right?

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.773
Press the button on the back of it.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:07.025
Y-You mean this?

00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:11.863
-The OTF control program is activated.
-Next!

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:16.242
Touch the PT-V2 module displayed
on the visor to start it up!

00:01:16.993 --> 00:01:17.869
Um...

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:03.414
FOXTROT

00:02:12.924 --> 00:02:15.885
It has changed from
Hotel mode to Foxtrot mode.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:16.845
She did that?

00:02:36.865 --> 00:02:38.283
It's beautiful.

00:02:39.742 --> 00:02:40.827
Third Class Amakasu.

00:02:41.202 --> 00:02:42.954
Do you remember the landing operation?

00:02:43.121 --> 00:02:44.164
Y-Yes.

00:02:44.581 --> 00:02:48.084
I'm supposed to rhythmically push my toes
toward my stomach,

00:02:48.376 --> 00:02:49.294
and--

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:57.802
-Cancel! Tell me how to cancel!
-Third Class Amakasu?!

